* Educational audio-path approximations; NOT manufacturer device models.
* BM83: ideal analog DAC outputs only. Bias/amplitude are adjustable assumptions.
.subckt BM83_AUDIO_APPROX AOHPL AOHPR GND
VL AOHPL GND SINE({VBIAS} {VSIG} {FTEST}) AC 1
VR AOHPR GND SINE({VBIAS} {VSIG} {FTEST}) AC 1
.ends BM83_AUDIO_APPROX

* TPA6130A2: differential input resistance and ideal voltage gain only.
* No clipping, bandwidth, noise, distortion, I2C, startup or charge-pump model.
* VDD is exposed for documentation/decoupling, but does not power this ideal model.
.subckt TPA6130A2_AUDIO_APPROX INML INPL INMR INPR HPLEFT HPRIGHT VDD GND
RLIN INPL INML {RINPUT}
RRIN INPR INMR {RINPUT}
* Numerical DC references for the AC-coupled ideal inputs; not real bias circuitry.
RBLP INPL GND 1G
RBLM INML GND 1G
RBRP INPR GND 1G
RBRM INMR GND 1G
EL HPLEFT GND INPL INML {AVOL}
ER HPRIGHT GND INPR INMR {AVOL}
.ends TPA6130A2_AUDIO_APPROX
